    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "1746e034-45ff-3084-8132-1f32147e43b3",
                "word": "longitudinal",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4b369657-498e-3237-8911-53f501bf0daf",
                        "entry_id": "1746e034-45ff-3084-8132-1f32147e43b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relating to length."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6a5a05d-4392-4f0f-9303-3c1da2e3ff3a",
                                "sense_id": "4b369657-498e-3237-8911-53f501bf0daf",
                                "text": "The motion about the longitudinal axis of an airplane is called roll."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d8e61a1d-e6d7-30d4-b202-fcb7ad4c8352",
                        "entry_id": "1746e034-45ff-3084-8132-1f32147e43b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relating to the geographical longitude."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "651a48b8-3d7f-47c2-8320-9d17abefd743",
                                "sense_id": "d8e61a1d-e6d7-30d4-b202-fcb7ad4c8352",
                                "text": "The longitudinal position of a ship refers to its angular distance east or west from the prime meridian."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6d9cdaec-de22-3ecd-bde7-be9cf8bb59dc",
                        "entry_id": "1746e034-45ff-3084-8132-1f32147e43b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Running in the direction of the long axis of a body."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c80904ed-1554-4847-8d0e-50d309c25d2b",
                                "sense_id": "6d9cdaec-de22-3ecd-bde7-be9cf8bb59dc",
                                "text": "The units have transverse seats, two and three astride the passageway with single or double longitudinal seats alongside the two entrance vestibules in each car."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e594fdd-6c5b-42bb-a7da-c4292fb354a7",
                                "sense_id": "6d9cdaec-de22-3ecd-bde7-be9cf8bb59dc",
                                "text": "The third rotation is about the longitudinal axis of the thigh."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "efcbdb0e-bc32-45e1-8a45-f06aa9de645e",
                                "sense_id": "6d9cdaec-de22-3ecd-bde7-be9cf8bb59dc",
                                "text": "Unlike the older trains, the new units have walk-through carriages and longitudinal rather than transverse seating."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1b8f0920-b4fb-3d9b-8a6e-f727caa990bb",
                        "entry_id": "1746e034-45ff-3084-8132-1f32147e43b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Forward and/or backward, relative to some defined direction."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "13194f02-defc-31a3-9898-bf5077f5897c",
                        "entry_id": "1746e034-45ff-3084-8132-1f32147e43b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sampling data over time rather than merely once."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2b14041-331a-4940-9675-626088fa8fa6",
                                "sense_id": "13194f02-defc-31a3-9898-bf5077f5897c",
                                "text": "longitudinal studies"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee44a068-dda2-4974-9994-99fd5c9010b9",
                                "sense_id": "13194f02-defc-31a3-9898-bf5077f5897c",
                                "text": "Examining national longitudinal data, Mossakowski has found that people who were unemployed for long periods in their teens or early 20s are far more likely to develop a habit of heavy drinking (five or more drinks in one sitting) by the time they approach middle age."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "257816bf-6bac-4353-ae31-b63736c7f173",
                        "source_entry_id": "1746e034-45ff-3084-8132-1f32147e43b3",
                        "source_sense_description": "relating to length",
                        "target_lang_word": "longitudinal",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "longitudinal",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ccdf52d-d914-3e23-9bf9-4ce96efb013b",
                                        "entry_id": "558ab9ca-ddfe-34d1-a2b2-0a93753c46eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est étendu en long."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Didactique"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98e1908a-2477-4a63-81c7-a35c78a37064",
                                                "sense_id": "4ccdf52d-d914-3e23-9bf9-4ce96efb013b",
                                                "text": "Corselet transversal, arrondi et bordé latéralement, très-fortement ponctué sur les bords, plus lisse et finement ponctué au milieu, où il est marqué d'une ligne longitudinale."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63aa9e6b-edb1-41ae-bbdb-6606286aff35",
                                                "sense_id": "4ccdf52d-d914-3e23-9bf9-4ce96efb013b",
                                                "text": "Quant aux anthères réellement unilobées, il est évident qu'elles s'ouvrent par une seule fente, qui, bien que longitudinale, paraît transversale, si cette anthère est, comme cela arrive fréquemment dans ce cas, renversée sur le dos à l'extrémité du filet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e5ff213-3313-4afa-8d5a-bcc23ae14330",
                                                "sense_id": "4ccdf52d-d914-3e23-9bf9-4ce96efb013b",
                                                "text": "Les éléments longitudinaux sont également continus; les quilles, contre-quilles et lisses sont en acajou; les élongis très largement dimensionnés sont en polyester renforcé de structure mixte mat-roving."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92e785a6-da42-4312-8a81-6ecfc7d2cde6",
                                                "sense_id": "4ccdf52d-d914-3e23-9bf9-4ce96efb013b",
                                                "text": "Les veines superficielles (qui drainent la majorité du cortex cérébral) se jettent essentiellement dans le sinus longitudinal supérieur, qui communique avec les sinus latéraux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf89506b-7cd3-373b-b98f-32a2f9267a56",
                                        "entry_id": "558ab9ca-ddfe-34d1-a2b2-0a93753c46eb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif à la longitude."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
